# transport.dic — factory / transport default keys (Fase 2, familia "transport")
#
# The keys a MIFARE Classic card ships with before an issuer personalises it.
# These are the highest-probability candidates on any card and by far the most
# common finding in the field (an unpersonalised sector = an exposed sector).
#
# Provenance: universally published factory defaults, present in every open
# MIFARE default-key set (libnfc, mfoc/mfcuk, Proxmark3 `mfc_default_keys.dic`,
# Flipper `mf_classic_dict.nfc`). Key values are facts, not copyrightable; the
# projects they are mirrored from are GPL/BSD. See dicts/README.md.
#
# Format: one 12-hex key per line; `#` comments and blanks ignored (load_keys).

